---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Private Tea House Experiences | Himaya Garden Tucson"
    description="Intimate private tea house gatherings in Tucson. Filipino-inspired and Royal High Tea menus for showers, celebrations, and memorable moments."
>
    <main>
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(132,147,118,0.18),_transparent_58%)]"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Tea house experiences</p>
                        <h1 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light leading-none text-charcoal">
                            An afternoon where time slows down.
                        </h1>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Intimate high tea gatherings designed for connection and celebration. Elegant tablescapes, handcrafted menus, and the warmth of Filipino hospitality in our garden tea house.
                        </p>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-3 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Reserve Private Tea</a>
                            <a href="/events" class="btn-secondary">See Upcoming Dates</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-4 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8 text-sm text-charcoal">
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">30-50</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Ideal guest count</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">2-3</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Hour experience</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Curated</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Menu options</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-lg">
                        <img src="/media/img/high tea two women eating at the table.jpeg" alt="Private tea house gathering" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Why hosts choose private tea</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        Elegant without being formal. Intimate without being exclusive.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <article class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">☕</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Effortless elegance</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            We handle every detail — from tablescapes to service — so you can focus on celebrating your guests.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🌸</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Beautiful setting</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Our tea house is already stunning — your guests walk in and immediately feel the care we put into every detail.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">❤️</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Genuine hospitality</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Guests feel truly welcomed. It's not transactional — it's personal, warm, and rooted in care.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Perfect for</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Any moment worth celebrating.
                        </h2>
                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            <p>
                                Whether it's a bridal shower, birthday, mother-daughter date, or simply gathering your closest friends, private tea is the perfect canvas for your celebration.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Bridal showers</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Celebration with meaning</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">An elegant afternoon honoring the bride-to-be in a space that feels personal and special.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Milestone birthdays</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">A day to remember</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Gather the people who matter most. Our team creates an atmosphere of warmth and celebration.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Girl's day out</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Connection and conversation</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">A destination gathering where friends, sisters, or colleagues pause and savor time together.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">The menu</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        Two curated experiences to choose from.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
                    <div class="fade-in bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-8 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-4">🇵🇭</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-charcoal mb-4">Filipino Inspired</h3>
                        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Heritage recipes passed through three generations. Delicate ube pastries, savory Filipino specialties, handcrafted sweets, and premium tea service.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Seasonal ube and specialty pastries</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Savory bites rooted in Cebuano tradition</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Artisan tea selection</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fade-in delay-1 bg-cream border border-sage/10 p-8 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="text-2xl mb-4">🇬🇧</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-charcoal mb-4">Royal High Tea</h3>
                        <p class="text-stone leading-relaxed mb-6">
                            Classic afternoon tea experience. Delicate finger sandwiches, fresh pastries, fruit, scones with clotted cream, and a premium tea service.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="space-y-3 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Tiered presentation</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Elegant finger sandwiches & pastries</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Premium loose-leaf tea selection</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
                        <img src="/media/img/collage-3_4.webp" alt="Tea house table setting" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">The experience</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Every detail is curated for your celebration.
                        </h2>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            From the moment your guests arrive, they'll feel the intention we put into every moment. Beautiful table settings, thoughtful service, and the warmth that makes memories.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Customizable décor and theme options</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Special dietary accommodations</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Flexible 2-3 hour time blocks</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32 md:py-40 text-center text-white">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
                <img src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg" alt="Tea house sunset" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/50 z-[1]"></div>
            <div class="relative z-[2] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <p class="section-label text-white/80 fade-in">Ready to gather?</p>
                <h2 class="fade-in font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light leading-tight mb-6">
                    Let's create an afternoon to remember.
                </h2>
                <p class="fade-in delay-1 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 text-white/80">
                    Check availability, explore menu options, and book your private tea experience.
                </p>
                <div class="fade-in delay-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Reserve Private Tea</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal">Inquire About Dates</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
